     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "shape": [
      "rlay"
     ],
     "description": "Band 2's water-vapour parameter WATER/(WATER + 0.002) with WATER = 1e20 COLH2O/COLDRY (TAUGB2 H2OPARAM)."
    },
    "ifrac_b02": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "shape": [
      "rlay"
     ],
     "description": "Reference-pressure interval of H2OPARAM on the decreasing REFPARAM(1..13) nodes: the first k in 2..12 with H2OPARAM >= REFPARAM(k), or 13 if none (TAUGB2 loop 1800 fall-through). Written as 13 minus the number of nodes k = 2..12 that H2OPARAM exceeds... exactly: the smallest k with H2OPARAM >= REFPARAM(k), i.e. 2 + (number of k in 2..12 with H2OPARAM < REFPARAM(k)) because REFPARAM decreases with k."
    },
    "fracint_b02": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "shape": [
      "rlay"
     ],
     "description": "Interpolation weight between REFPARAM(IFRAC) and REFPARAM(IFRAC-1): (H2OPARAM - REFPARAM(IFRAC))/(REFPARAM(IFRAC-1) - REFPARAM(IFRAC)) (TAUGB2 FRACINT)."
    },
